WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:09.764
Reports are sets of widgets made to be read and sent. Open one any time, or have it emailed every morning, with a short AI summary on top.

2
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:19.943
Reports has its own place in the sidebar, right after Dashboards. Here are the reports you made, and the ones shared with you, with how often each is emailed.

3
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:30.384
Start one with New Report, or Describe a report, and AI builds it. Reports use the same widgets as dashboards: tickets, and data from your connected tools.

4
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.801
To send it on a schedule, open the report and click Email.

5
00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:45.123
Tick Send it on a schedule. Pick every day, weekdays, a day each week, or a day each month, and the time. Add the people who get it, and choose the AI for the summary.

6
00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:54.079
Each person gets their own copy, worked out as them, so they only see numbers they’re allowed to see. Under Last send, you can check who got it.

7
00:00:54.533 --> 00:00:59.461
If Reports is turned off, scheduled emails pause, and pick up again when it’s back on.

